    "slides": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "As the years add up, we quietly reach the exact ages where our earliest memories of our parents and elders took root.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "BURGUNDY",
        "accent": "BURGUNDY"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "The pedestal of childhood omniscience falls away, replaced by the startling realization that they were simply adults improvising under weight.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "BURGUNDY",
        "accent": "BURGUNDY"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The silences, stern rules, and sudden moves were rarely who they were, but how they coped.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "BURGUNDY",
        "accent": "BURGUNDY"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "Standing on the same terrain of adulthood, our old grievances soften into an understanding of shared human limitations.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "BURGUNDY",
        "accent": "BURGUNDY"
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "text": "Time gradually transforms inherited judgment into a quiet, equal recognition of what it costs everyone to navigate a life.",
        "closing": true,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "BURGUNDY",
        "accent": "BURGUNDY"
